   {
    "field": "function",
    "value": "Pericytes are stem cells found in some small blood vessels, and they let smooth muscle tissue regenerate and repair much more readily than skeletal or cardiac muscle.",
    "quote": "Smooth muscle tissue can regenerate from a type of stem cell called a pericyte, which is found in some small blood vessels. Pericytes allow smooth muscle cells to regenerate and repair much more readily than skeletal and cardiac muscle tissue.",
